WAP in C to subtract  2 numbers, take input from the user.

File Extension:
.c : C language (v Imp)
.txt : notepad
.cc : CPP
.cpp : cpp
.cs : csharp
.java : Java
.o : object
.exe : executable


file.c Compile file.o interpret file.exe

file.c -> Debug -> file.exe


%d  -> int
%f -> float
%c -> char



WAP to input a number and print the multiplication table

Example:
Enter a number: 2

Table:
2 * 1 = 2
2 * 2 = 4
..
2 * 10 = 20

int x, i;
print->Enter a number:
scan -> x
i=0
print("%d * %d = %d\n",x,++i,(x*i))
..10 times








